# Julia's taste

Hunny House is the **browsing feel**, not a clone. Brand is Coast Collection (handmade knot bags + appliqué tanks).

- **Shop** is a separate `/shop` page. Homepage header does not need a Shop link on mobile; the **hero button** goes to `/shop`.
- **Phone:** hamburger **drawer** (slide + fade). **Cart stays in the header.** Desktop: **Shop only** in the header (same type as Account / Search / Cart) — no hamburger, no Knot bags / Appliqué tanks links.
- Hero title uses the **header serif**, larger. Marquee must loop with **no blank gap**.
- **Footer:** thin (copyright, Instagram, TikTok, Shipping). Not a second Account/Cart column.
- Nav lists are **plain rows** (links/`<button>`). Do not use the shared `Button` chrome in the drawer — it draws boxes.
- One homepage product **rail** (all products). Shop page is a **grid** (2 / 3 / 4 cols). Collage is **full-bleed**.
- Marquee must **loop**. Taps ≥ 44px. Account / Search / Cart stay stubs — no fake Stripe.
- After UI work, check **phone width and desktop**. Screenshot-only is not enough.

Durable notes: `docs/feedback/taste.md`. New videos: skill `apply-julia-feedback`.
